    <section class="pw-container">
        <div class="pw-w-8/12 pw-m-auto">
            


        </div>

            <div class="pw-text-block pw-w-8/12">
                <div>
                    

<p class="Paragraph SCXW155870473 BCX8 pw-preamble">SEB&nbsp;maintains a strong liquidity position and has good access to funding through its stable and diversified customer deposit base and in the capital markets, supported by its strong credit rating.</p>
<p>Our liquidity and funding strategy is managed from three perspectives:</p>
<ul class="pw-usp">
<li class="Paragraph SCXW155870473 BCX8">Optimising the liquidity structure of the balance sheet to ensure that less liquid assets are matched with stable funding.</li>
<li class="Paragraph SCXW155870473 BCX8">Monitoring wholesale funding dependence and diversification of the deposit base.</li>
<li class="Paragraph SCXW155870473 BCX8">
<p>Ensuring that the bank has sufficient liquidity reserves to withstand a severely stressed scenario.</p>
</li>
</ul>

                </div>
            </div>
    </section>


    <div class="pw-block-area">


<div class="pw-container">

<section class="pw-grid-group">


